Package: rok
Title: Fast Package and Project Manager for R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Yosuke", "Abe", email = "kumakorodadda@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Manages the packages and the R version of a project, in the
    spirit of 'uv' for 'Python'. Packages are resolved from dated snapshots
    of the 'Posit Package Manager' and recorded in a lockfile, so that a
    project can be reproduced as it was. The work is done by the 'rok'
    command-line program, which this package downloads on first use, after
    asking.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: tools, utils
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
